    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Robin",
        "text": "You're... the one hiring me?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_451_robin#2",
            "name2": "avg_npc_137#9",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "I am. Here in the flesh."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "I sympathize with your experiences, but I have figured out how you tick. I know you aren't willing to take charity, and I don't like giving others charity either."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "So I've prepared for you a deal."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_451_robin#3",
            "name2": "avg_npc_137#9",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Robin",
        "text": "Why would you tell me all that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_137#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "Of course, I was not planning to reach out to you at first. Only, this move Mr. Anthony made has forced me out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "Forgive my sorrows once more, but after living in here, even I was one step away from Mr. Anthony's boldness winning me over."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_137#9"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "And if I hadn't told you any of this, you would've let that cheap sympathy go to your head, and you would've chosen to help him."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "And if I were running some basic con on you today\u2014say, Mr. Anthony brought your ol' man's company down\u2014I'd worry about you hearing the full picture from his side soon enough."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "And wouldn't I look like a cheat and a scoundrel then? You'd want nothing to do with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "So I may as well tell you everything you oughta know. Let you choose for yourself."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "Go and put all those past disputes to one side. Just think about this one, simple question\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Jesselton",
        "text": "You gonna choose to help him out of sympathy with likely no returns, or are you gonna help me for all I've promised in your interest?"
    },
